VbVuZvM16PQQ7kNvwGfbWke&_nc_oc=AdpGqFb52Ty8_EPukOPI5bTeXB5gDvTADGIjJOFIcKSmHhK51-AG1A9akJrtE50Bem0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ4wxPBDYOz1FpF5qmS8MzpdgxY5ZFDVEY_50n28fAGHA&oe=6A986777"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UNp__PYktvAQ7kNvwHRQKp_&_nc_oc=AdpCyTdFSw-T0GFlq-4uB6w16U0mNi5sVljiMPlHjUZFKV864QD7YS7n-QSONe101to&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK7m5Jzqj0NtysFkEimjyw0Jv-X6TIwhMVjfQTkCfNuYg&oe=6A98690A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o-Sye7xN7awQ7kNvwHSkmaB&_nc_oc=AdoM-CvUzxK19GaWgh160tt8f3FZwvJR9sHIZ65V9bUTFGinMnO__y-875e2TZdp_T8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK3MBp-GvBI4N9Ae-sYumMxCdCBrUEmMnm_eGquJwhSIQ&oe=6A98562F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tWdbqODXdAkQ7kNvwHGvE-C&_nc_oc=Adpmg9l0HaEOb72u00lWxF96sJMU1Je_T5C3fxaDx6WliXvEhnQTR-odIDdY5Bq360w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJvBS3XMegF7ZKq91hNes-9jpzoYMqey_s_PrGvXmDylA&oe=6A983F83"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Z7R_61MxevUQ7kNvwGs0lUu&_nc_oc=Adok-hRC3KccA5SXChXcwQHqtlJFLlnIyQIJOBDtlYCQY7f3h9FD-lhaMhRnwTLO6r0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJgg8CjYDmosUGENsGdmdfjEPD-lSxNfoqPvpASwLd57A&oe=6A9837D8"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tS9MgniIxkgQ7kNvwHSam9E&_nc_oc=Adoo6bGItC6IK2eOtts0_of7BZtvCWBa483NYxlD_Wn1u4mvkCP_3Pk_jJOvk4YUC5I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLj0PLPvKVoXvTWHVKG764r4VnqR9-hVfd4jLEiJhjbpQ&oe=6A984AFC"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080